---
/**
 * GuideSection — empathy + authority. PEACE: E + A.
 */
---

<section class="section bg-cumberland-forest text-cumberland-cream">
  <div class="container-rail grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 items-start">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <p class="eyebrow text-cumberland-stone">Your print shop, since 2003</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4">We've been the print shop for the Upper Cumberland for 23 years.</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-cumberland-mist">
        We know what it's like when the season opener is Friday and the shirts
        haven't shipped, when the grand opening is in two weeks and there's
        still no sign on the building, when the church bus needs new lettering
        before the youth trip leaves.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-cumberland-mist">
        That's why every Cumberland Signworks order has a real human on it —
        from sketch to final delivery. No portals to fight. No call centers to
        escalate. Just a shop full of folks who do this every day and have done
        it more than 1,000 times in your community.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-cumberland-forest-dark/60 p-6">
        <svg class="mt-1 h-7 w-7 shrink-0 text-cumberland-clay" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.788 3.21c.448-1.077 1.976-1.077 2.424 0l2.082 5.006 5.404.434c1.164.093 1.636 1.545.749 2.305l-4.117 3.527 1.257 5.273c.271 1.136-.964 2.033-1.96 1.425L12 18.354 7.373 21.18c-.996.608-2.231-.29-1.96-1.425l1.257-5.273-4.117-3.527c-.887-.76-.415-2.212.749-2.305l5.404-.434 2.082-5.006Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-2xl tracking-tighter">4.7 stars · 95+ reviews</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-cumberland-mist">
            Known for fast turnaround, rush orders, and friendly handling.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-cumberland-forest-dark/60 p-6">
        <svg class="mt-1 h-7 w-7 shrink-0 text-cumberland-clay" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M11.644 1.59a.75.75 0 0 1 .712 0l9.75 5.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.32l-9.75 5.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.712 0l-9.75-5.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.32l9.75-5.25Z" />
          <path d="m3.265 10.602 7.668 4.129a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.134 0l7.668-4.13 1.37.739a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.32l-9.75 5.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.71 0l-9.75-5.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.32l1.37-.738Z" />
          <path d="m10.933 19.231-7.668-4.13-1.37.739a.75.75 0 0 0 0 1.32l9.75 5.25c.221.12.489.12.71 0l9.75-5.25a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.32l-1.37-.738-7.668 4.13a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.134-.001Z" />
        </svg>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-2xl tracking-tighter">In-house everything</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-cumberland-mist">
            Screen print, embroidery, digital, vinyl, signage, full vehicle wraps.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-cumberland-forest-dark/60 p-6">
        <svg class="mt-1 h-7 w-7 shrink-0 text-cumberland-clay" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m11.54 22.351.07.04.028.016a.76.76 0 0 0 .723 0l.028-.015.071-.041a16.975 16.975 0 0 0 1.144-.742 19.58 19.58 0 0 0 2.683-2.282c1.944-1.99 3.963-4.98 3.963-8.827a8.25 8.25 0 0 0-16.5 0c0 3.846 2.02 6.837 3.963 8.827a19.58 19.58 0 0 0 2.682 2.282 16.975 16.975 0 0 0 1.145.742ZM12 13.5a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-2xl tracking-tighter">Locally owned · Crossville, TN</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-cumberland-mist">
            Same family. Same shop. Same standards. 23 years.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
